## Data stores (two DBs)

### Schedule DB (user data)

- file: `bibleAlarm.db` (`AppConstants.Database.ScheduleDatabaseFileName`)
- context: `src/Bible.Alarm.Shared/Database/ScheduleDbContext.cs`
- main tables:
  - `AlarmSchedules`
  - `BiblePublicationSchedules` (1:1 with `AlarmSchedules`)
  - `AlarmMusic` (1:1 with `AlarmSchedules`, “begin with music”, legacy/back-compat)
  - `AlarmNotifications`, `GeneralSettings`

### Media index DB (catalog/index)

- file: `mediaIndex.db` (`AppConstants.Database.MediaIndexDatabaseFileName`)
- context: `src/Bible.Alarm.Shared/Database/MediaDbContext.cs`
- populated by the cataloger tool; shipped to app as `index.zip` embedded resource

See `databases-and-migrations.mdc` for schema + relationships.

